  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The equivalent resistance of the circuit shown below between points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> is :</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/74b8b29b-b5ea-4fc8-8a88-2433ea68bb71.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 303px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "uu0Cp",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "WPINu",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Qsge2",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "FeygE",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fc361815-e504-4783-a2ff-6777aa56ac3d.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 255px;\" /></p><p>The resistance in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is parallel to all other resistances. Since all the resistances other than&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;the potential is zero<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> as the upper branch will become a case of balanced wheatstone bridge between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>&#38;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></math>. So, the simplified circuit looks like the one below.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6cd3aef0-bf8a-4c14-a9a3-ab08a39787f8.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 236px;\" /></p><p>Hence, the equivalent resistance is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
